function InventoryReferencePage({page,students,onPage,onCreate,onSaved}:{page:string;students:Student[];onPage:(p:string)=>void;onCreate:(p:Record<string,unknown>)=>Promise<boolean>;onSaved:(message:string)=>void}){
  const [items,setItems]=useState(previewInventory),[categories,setCategories]=useState(["Books","Lab Supplies","Medical / First Aid","Sports Equipment","Stationery","Uniforms"]),[suppliers,setSuppliers]=useState(previewSuppliers),[movements,setMovements]=useState(previewMovements),[issues,setIssues]=useState(previewIssues),[sales,setSales]=useState(previewSales),[orders,setOrders]=useState(previewOrders),[receipts,setReceipts]=useState<GoodsReceipt[]>([{id:"gr1",number:"GRN-2026-0041",po:"PO-2026-0012",supplier:"Sharma Stationers",date:"2026-07-24",lines:2,by:"Inventory Admin"}]),[payments,setPayments]=useState<SupplierPayment[]>([{id:"py1",supplier:"Sharma Stationers",po:"PO-2026-0012",amount:4000,date:"2026-07-25",mode:"Bank Transfer",reference:"UTR29180165",by:"Super Admin"}]);
  const tabs=[["Inventory Dashboard","Dashboard"],["Inventory Guide","Guide"],["Item List","Items"],["Item Categories","Categories"],["Add Stock","Add Stock"],["Adjustments","Adjustments"],["Issue Item","Issue / Return"],["Point of Sale","POS"],["Sales History","Sales"]];
  const more=[["Vendor Collections","Vendor Collections"],["Purchase Orders","Purchase Orders"],["Goods Receipts","Goods Receipts"],["Supplier Payments","Supplier Payments"],["Suppliers","Suppliers"],["Inventory Reports","Reports"]];
  const addMovement=(m:Omit<StockMovement,"id">)=>setMovements(v=>[{...m,id:crypto.randomUUID()},...v]);
  const changeStock=(id:string,delta:number)=>setItems(v=>v.map(x=>x.id===id?{...x,quantity:Math.max(0,x.quantity+delta)}:x));
  async function record(workflow:string,title:string,description:string){await onCreate({moduleKey:"Inventory",workflow,title,description,recordDate:today(),status:"completed",priority:"normal"});}
  let content:ReactNode;
  if(page==="Inventory Guide")content=<InventoryGuide onPage={onPage}/>;
  else if(page==="Item List")content=<InventoryItems items={items} categories={categories} onPage={onPage}/>;
  else if(page==="Add Item")content=<InventoryItemForm categories={categories} onBack={()=>onPage("Item List")} onSave={item=>{setItems(v=>[item,...v]);onSaved(`${item.name} added to the item master.`);onPage("Item List");record("Item master",item.name,item.sku);}}/>;
  else if(page==="Item Categories")content=<InventoryCategories categories={categories} items={items} setCategories={setCategories}/>;
  else if(page==="Add Stock")content=<InventoryAddStock items={items} suppliers={suppliers} movements={movements} onAdd={(id,quantity,supplier,date,cost,notes)=>{const item=items.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!item)return;changeStock(id,quantity);addMovement({itemId:id,itemName:item.name,kind:"Stock Added",quantity,date,party:supplier,notes:`${notes} · ${inr(cost)}`});onSaved(`${quantity} ${item.unit.toLowerCase()} added to ${item.name}.`);record("Stock receipt",item.name,`${quantity} received from ${supplier}`);}}/>;
  else if(page==="Adjustments")content=<InventoryAdjustments items={items} movements={movements} onAdjust={(id,delta,date,reason,notes)=>{const item=items.find(x=>x.id===id);if(!item)return;changeStock(id,delta);addMovement({itemId:id,itemName:item.name,kind:`Adjustment — ${reason}`,quantity:delta,date,party:"Inventory Admin",notes});onSaved(`Stock adjustment saved for ${item.name}.`);}}/>;
  else if(page==="Issue Item")content=<InventoryIssueReturn items={items} students={students} issues={issues} onIssue={(issue)=>{setIssues(v=>[issue,...v]);changeStock(issue.itemId,-issue.quantity);addMovement({itemId:issue.itemId,itemName:issue.itemName,kind:"Issued",quantity:-issue.quantity,date:issue.date,party:issue.recipient,notes:issue.recipientType});onSaved(`${issue.itemName} issued to ${issue.recipient}.`);}} onReturn={(issue,quantity)=>{setIssues(v=>v.map(x=>x.id===issue.id?{...x,returned:x.returned+quantity,status:x.returned+quantity>=x.quantity?"Returned":"Partially Returned"}:x));changeStock(issue.itemId,quantity);addMovement({itemId:issue.itemId,itemName:issue.itemName,kind:"Returned",quantity,date:today(),party:issue.recipient,notes:"Issue return"});onSaved(`${quantity} ${issue.itemName} returned.`);}}/>;
  else if(page==="Point of Sale")content=<InventoryPos items={items} students={students} suppliers={suppliers} onSale={sale=>{setSales(v=>[sale,...v]);sale.lines.forEach(line=>changeStock(line.itemId,-line.quantity));onSaved(`${sale.invoice} completed for ${inr(sale.net)}.`);record("POS sale",sale.invoice,`${sale.buyer} · ${inr(sale.net)}`);}}/>;
  else if(page==="Sales History")content=<InventorySales sales={sales}/>;
  else if(page==="Vendor Collections")content=<InventoryVendorCollections sales={sales} suppliers={suppliers}/>;
  else if(page==="Purchase Orders"||page==="New Purchase Order")content=<InventoryPurchaseOrders orders={orders} suppliers={suppliers} onPage={onPage} create={page==="New Purchase Order"} onSave={order=>{setOrders(v=>[order,...v]);onSaved(`${order.number} saved as draft.`);onPage("Purchase Orders");}} onStatus={(id,status)=>setOrders(v=>v.map(x=>x.id===id?{...x,status}:x))}/>;
  else if(page==="Goods Receipts")content=<InventoryReceipts orders={orders} receipts={receipts} items={items} onReceive={(po,itemId,quantity)=>{const item=items.find(x=>x.id===itemId);if(!item)return;const receipt:GoodsReceipt={id:crypto.randomUUID(),number:`GRN-2026-${String(receipts.length+42).padStart(4,"0")}`,po:po.number,supplier:po.supplier,date:today(),lines:1,by:"Super Admin"};setReceipts(v=>[receipt,...v]);setOrders(v=>v.map(x=>x.id===po.id?{...x,status:"Received"}:x));changeStock(itemId,quantity);addMovement({itemId,itemName:item.name,kind:"Goods Received",quantity,date:today(),party:po.supplier,notes:receipt.number});onSaved(`${receipt.number} posted and stock updated.`);}}/>;
  else if(page==="Supplier Payments")content=<InventoryPayments suppliers={suppliers} orders={orders} payments={payments} onSave={payment=>{setPayments(v=>[payment,...v]);onSaved(`Payment of ${inr(payment.amount)} recorded.`);}}/>;
  else if(page==="Suppliers")content=<InventorySuppliers suppliers={suppliers} setSuppliers={setSuppliers}/>;
  else if(page==="Inventory Reports")content=<InventoryReports items={items} movements={movements} sales={sales} orders={orders} payments={payments}/>;
  else content=<InventoryDashboard items={items} movements={movements} sales={sales} suppliers={suppliers} orders={orders} onPage={onPage}/>;
  if(page==="Add Item"||page==="New Purchase Order")return content;
  return <><section className={styles.inventoryHeader}><div><h1>Inventory &amp; Stock</h1><p>Track items, stock, expiry, issuance, sales, suppliers and procurement.</p></div><button onClick={()=>onPage("Add Item")}>＋ Add Item</button></section><nav className={styles.inventoryTabs}>{tabs.map(([key,label])=><button className={page===key?styles.inventoryTabActive:""} onClick={()=>onPage(key)} key={key}>{label}</button>)}<select aria-label="More inventory pages" value={more.some(([key])=>key===page)?page:""} onChange={e=>e.target.value&&onPage(e.target.value)}><option value="">More Menu</option>{more.map(([key,label])=><option value={key} key={key}>{label}</option>)}</select></nav>{content}</>;
}

function InventoryDashboard({items,movements,sales,suppliers,orders,onPage}:{items:InventoryItem[];movements:StockMovement[];sales:InventorySale[];suppliers:InventorySupplier[];orders:PurchaseOrder[];onPage:(p:string)=>void}){
  const low=items.filter(x=>x.quantity<=x.minStock),expired=items.filter(x=>x.expiry&&x.expiry<today()),value=items.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+x.quantity*x.purchasePrice,0),categoryTotals=Object.entries(items.reduce<Record<string,number>>((acc,x)=>({...acc,[x.category]:(acc[x.category]??0)+x.quantity}),{}));
  return <><section className={styles.inventoryStats}>{[["IT","Total Items",items.length,"Active item records"],["LO","Low Stock",low.length,"At or below reorder level"],["EX","Expired Items",expired.length,"Requires attention"],["₹","Stock Value",inr(value),"At purchase cost"]].map(([icon,label,val,note],i)=><button onClick={()=>onPage(i===1?"Item List":i===2?"Inventory Reports":"Item List")} key={String(label)}><i>{icon}</i><span>{label}<b>{val}</b><small>{note}</small></span></button>)}</section><section className={styles.inventoryDashGrid}><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Items by Category" subtitle="Current units across categories"/><div className={styles.inventoryBars}>{categoryTotals.map(([name,count])=><div key={name}><span>{name}</span><i><b style={{width:`${Math.min(100,count*2)}%`}}/></i><strong>{count}</strong></div>)}</div></article><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Recent Activity" subtitle="Live stock ledger"/><div className={styles.inventoryActivity}>{movements.slice(0,5).map(x=><p key={x.id}><i className={x.quantity>0?styles.stockIn:styles.stockOut}>{x.quantity>0?"IN":"OUT"}</i><span><b>{x.itemName}</b><small>{x.kind} · {x.party}</small></span><strong>{x.quantity>0?"+":""}{x.quantity}</strong></p>)}</div></article><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Low-Stock Items" subtitle={`${low.length} items require replenishment`} action="View items" onClick={()=>onPage("Item List")}/><div className={styles.inventoryAlerts}>{low.map(x=><p key={x.id}><span><b>{x.name}</b><small>{x.sku} · reorder at {x.minStock}</small></span><strong>{x.quantity} {x.unit}</strong></p>)}</div></article><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Operations" subtitle="Procurement and sales overview"/><div className={styles.inventoryOps}>{[["PO","Purchase Orders",orders.length,()=>onPage("Purchase Orders")],["SL","Sales this month",sales.length,()=>onPage("Sales History")],["SP","Active Suppliers",suppliers.length,()=>onPage("Suppliers")],["POS","Open Point of Sale","Start billing",()=>onPage("Point of Sale")]].map(([icon,label,val,go])=><button onClick={go as ()=>void} key={String(label)}><i>{String(icon)}</i><span>{String(label)}<b>{String(val)}</b></span><em>›</em></button>)}</div></article></section></>;
}

function InventoryGuide({onPage}:{onPage:(p:string)=>void}){const stages=[["1","Procure","Create a purchase order, approve it and send it to a supplier.","Purchase Orders"],["2","Receive","Post a GRN to increase stock and preserve batch cost.","Goods Receipts"],["3","Use or sell","Issue to people/departments or bill through POS.","Issue Item"],["4","Control","Adjust variances, manage expiry and run audit reports.","Inventory Reports"]];return <><section className={styles.inventoryGuideHero}><span>INVENTORY MODULE GUIDE</span><h2>From purchase order to final issue</h2><p>A connected stock ledger keeps every addition, issue, return, sale and correction traceable.</p></section><section className={styles.inventoryGuideFlow}>{stages.map(([n,title,text,page])=><article className={styles.panel} key={n}><i>{n}</i><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p><button onClick={()=>onPage(page)}>Open {title} →</button></article>)}</section><section className={styles.inventoryGuideGrid}>{[["Item master","Maintain unit, type, purchase and selling prices, minimum stock, expiry date, barcode and description."],["Stock adjustments","Record damage, expiry, loss, corrections and opening balances with a signed audit trail."],["Issue & return","Issue items to students, staff or departments; returns automatically restore available stock."],["Point of sale","Build a cart, apply line discount and GST, select buyer/payment mode and generate an invoice."],["Vendor billing","Mark a sale as vendor-on-behalf so collections remain payable to the correct supplier."],["Procurement","Draft PO → approve/send → receive GRN → record supplier payment, with partial and received states."]].map(([title,text])=><article className={styles.panel} key={title}><h3>{title}</h3><p>{text}</p></article>)}</section></>;}

function InventoryItems({items,categories,onPage}:{items:InventoryItem[];categories:string[];onPage:(p:string)=>void}){const [search,setSearch]=useState(""),[category,setCategory]=useState("All"),[type,setType]=useState("All"),[stock,setStock]=useState("All");const filtered=items.filter(x=>(category==="All"||x.category===category)&&(type==="All"||x.type===type)&&(stock==="All"||(stock==="Low"&&x.quantity<=x.minStock)||(stock==="Out"&&x.quantity===0)||(stock==="Expired"&&x.expiry&&x.expiry<today()))&&`${x.name} ${x.sku}`.toLowerCase().includes(search.toLowerCase()));return <><div className={styles.inventoryActionBar}><label>⌕<input value={search} onChange={e=>setSearch(e.target.value)} placeholder="Search item or SKU…"/></label><select value={category} onChange={e=>setCategory(e.target.value)}><option>All</option>{categories.map(x=><option key={x}>{x}</option>)}</select><select value={type} onChange={e=>setType(e.target.value)}><option>All</option><option>Consumable</option><option>Saleable</option></select><select value={stock} onChange={e=>setStock(e.target.value)}><option>All</option><option>Low</option><option>Out</option><option>Expired</option></select><button onClick={()=>onPage("Add Item")}>＋ Add Item</button></div><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Item Master" subtitle={`${filtered.length} matching inventory records`}/><CommExport/><div className={styles.inventoryTable}><div>{["#","Item","SKU","Category","Type","In Stock","Unit Price","Expiry","Status","Actions"].map(x=><b key={x}>{x}</b>)}</div>{filtered.map((x,i)=><div key={x.id}><span>{i+1}</span><p><b>{x.name}</b><small>{x.unit} · {x.barcode}</small></p><span>{x.sku}</span><span>{x.category}</span><em>{x.type}</em><strong className={x.quantity<=x.minStock?styles.inventoryDanger:""}>{x.quantity}</strong><span>{inr(x.sellingPrice)}</span><span>{x.expiry||"—"}</span><em className={x.quantity===0?styles.invRed:x.quantity<=x.minStock?styles.invAmber:styles.invGreen}>{x.quantity===0?"Out":x.quantity<=x.minStock?"Low":"In Stock"}</em><span><button>View</button><button>Edit</button></span></div>)}</div><TablePager count={filtered.length}/></article></>;}

function InventoryItemForm({categories,onBack,onSave}:{categories:string[];onBack:()=>void;onSave:(item:InventoryItem)=>void}){return <section className={styles.inventoryFormPage}><header><button onClick={onBack}>← Back to Items</button><h1>Add Inventory Item</h1><p>Create the item master before receiving, issuing or selling stock.</p></header><form className={`${styles.panel} ${styles.inventoryForm}`} onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);onSave({id:crypto.randomUUID(),name:String(f.get("name")),sku:String(f.get("sku")),category:String(f.get("category")),type:String(f.get("type")) as InventoryItem["type"],unit:String(f.get("unit")),quantity:Number(f.get("quantity")),minStock:Number(f.get("minStock")),purchasePrice:Number(f.get("purchasePrice")),sellingPrice:Number(f.get("sellingPrice")),expiry:String(f.get("expiry")),barcode:String(f.get("barcode")),description:String(f.get("description"))});}}><h2>Item Details</h2><label className={styles.invWide}>Item Name *<input name="name" required placeholder="e.g., A4 Copier Paper"/></label><label>SKU / Item Code *<input name="sku" required placeholder="ST-A4-75"/></label><label>Barcode<input name="barcode" placeholder="Scan or enter barcode"/></label><label>Category *<select name="category" required><option value="">Select category</option>{categories.map(x=><option key={x}>{x}</option>)}</select></label><label>Item Type *<select name="type"><option>Consumable</option><option>Saleable</option></select></label><label>Unit *<select name="unit"><option>Piece</option><option>Box</option><option>Pack</option><option>Set</option><option>Ream</option><option>Kit</option><option>Kg</option><option>Litre</option></select></label><label>Opening Stock<input name="quantity" type="number" min="0" defaultValue="0"/></label><label>Minimum Stock Level<input name="minStock" type="number" min="0" defaultValue="5"/></label><label>Purchase Price<input name="purchasePrice" type="number" min="0" step=".01"/></label><label>Selling Price<input name="sellingPrice" type="number" min="0" step=".01"/></label><label>Expiry Date<input name="expiry" type="date"/></label><label className={styles.invWide}>Description<textarea name="description" placeholder="Item specification, storage notes or usage instructions…"/></label><FormActions cancel={onBack} submit="Save Item"/></form></section>;}

function InventoryCategories({categories,items,setCategories}:{categories:string[];items:InventoryItem[];setCategories:(updater:(v:string[])=>string[])=>void}){const [modal,setModal]=useState(false);return <><div className={styles.inventoryActionBar}><span/><button onClick={()=>setModal(true)}>＋ Add Category</button></div><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Item Categories" subtitle="Organise consumable and saleable inventory"/><CommExport/><SimpleRecordTable headers={["#","Category","Type","Description","Items","Actions"]} rows={categories.map((x,i)=>[i+1,x,items.find(y=>y.category===x)?.type??"Consumable",`${x} inventory and stock`,items.filter(y=>y.category===x).length,"Edit · Delete"])}/><TablePager count={categories.length}/></article>{modal&&<div className={styles.commModal}><form onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget),name=String(f.get("name")).trim();if(name)setCategories(v=>v.includes(name)?v:[...v,name]);setModal(false);}}><header><h2>Add Category</h2><button type="button" onClick={()=>setModal(false)}>×</button></header><label>Name *<input name="name" required/></label><label>Type<select><option>Consumable</option><option>Saleable</option></select></label><label>Description<textarea placeholder="Category description"/></label><label>Icon (FontAwesome)<input placeholder="fa-box"/></label><div className={styles.modalActions}><button type="button" onClick={()=>setModal(false)}>Cancel</button><button>Save Category</button></div></form></div>}</>;}

function InventoryAddStock({items,suppliers,movements,onAdd}:{items:InventoryItem[];suppliers:InventorySupplier[];movements:StockMovement[];onAdd:(id:string,quantity:number,supplier:string,date:string,cost:number,notes:string)=>void}){return <section className={styles.inventorySplit}><form className={`${styles.panel} ${styles.inventoryCompactForm}`} onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);onAdd(String(f.get("item")),Number(f.get("quantity")),String(f.get("supplier")),String(f.get("date")),Number(f.get("cost")),String(f.get("notes")));e.currentTarget.reset();}}><PanelHead title="Add Stock" subtitle="Receive inventory directly without a purchase order"/><label>Item *<select name="item" required><option value="">Select item</option>{items.map(x=><option value={x.id} key={x.id}>{x.name} · {x.quantity} in stock</option>)}</select></label><label>Supplier<select name="supplier"><option>Direct / Opening Stock</option>{suppliers.map(x=><option key={x.id}>{x.name}</option>)}</select></label><label>Quantity *<input name="quantity" type="number" min="1" required/></label><label>Date *<input name="date" type="date" required defaultValue={today()}/></label><label>Cost Total<input name="cost" type="number" min="0" step=".01"/></label><label className={styles.invWide}>Description<textarea name="notes" placeholder="Invoice, batch or receiving note"/></label><button>Add Stock</button></form><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Recent Stock Additions" subtitle="Most recent incoming movements"/><SimpleRecordTable headers={["Date","Item","Supplier","Qty","Reference"]} rows={movements.filter(x=>x.quantity>0).map(x=>[x.date,x.itemName,x.party,`+${x.quantity}`,x.notes])}/></article></section>;}

function InventoryAdjustments({items,movements,onAdjust}:{items:InventoryItem[];movements:StockMovement[];onAdjust:(id:string,delta:number,date:string,reason:string,notes:string)=>void}){return <section className={styles.inventorySplit}><form className={`${styles.panel} ${styles.inventoryCompactForm}`} onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget),quantity=Number(f.get("quantity")),direction=String(f.get("direction"));onAdjust(String(f.get("item")),direction==="Increase"?quantity:-quantity,String(f.get("date")),String(f.get("reason")),String(f.get("notes")));e.currentTarget.reset();}}><PanelHead title="Stock Adjustment" subtitle="Record damage, loss, expiry or a counted correction"/><label>Item *<select name="item" required><option value="">Select item</option>{items.map(x=><option value={x.id} key={x.id}>{x.name} · current {x.quantity}</option>)}</select></label><label>Direction<select name="direction"><option>Decrease</option><option>Increase</option></select></label><label>Reason<select name="reason"><option>Damage</option><option>Expired</option><option>Lost</option><option>Correction</option><option>Opening Balance</option></select></label><label>Quantity *<input name="quantity" type="number" min="1" required/></label><label>Date *<input name="date" type="date" defaultValue={today()} required/></label><label className={styles.invWide}>Notes<textarea name="notes" required placeholder="Why is this adjustment required?"/></label><button>Save Adjustment</button></form><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Adjustment History" subtitle="Audited inventory corrections"/><SimpleRecordTable headers={["Date","Item","Reason","Change","By","Notes"]} rows={movements.filter(x=>x.kind.includes("Adjustment")).map(x=>[x.date,x.itemName,x.kind,x.quantity,x.party,x.notes])}/></article></section>;}

function InventoryIssueReturn({items,students,issues,onIssue,onReturn}:{items:InventoryItem[];students:Student[];issues:InventoryIssue[];onIssue:(issue:InventoryIssue)=>void;onReturn:(issue:InventoryIssue,quantity:number)=>void}){const [recipientType,setRecipientType]=useState("Department");return <><section className={styles.inventorySplit}><form className={`${styles.panel} ${styles.inventoryCompactForm}`} onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget),item=items.find(x=>x.id===f.get("item"));if(!item)return;onIssue({id:crypto.randomUUID(),itemId:item.id,itemName:item.name,recipientType,recipient:String(f.get("recipient")),quantity:Number(f.get("quantity")),date:String(f.get("date")),returned:0,status:"Issued"});e.currentTarget.reset();}}><PanelHead title="Issue Item" subtitle="Issue stock to a student, staff member or department"/><label>Item *<select name="item" required><option value="">Select available item</option>{items.filter(x=>x.quantity>0).map(x=><option value={x.id} key={x.id}>{x.name} · {x.quantity} available</option>)}</select></label><label>Recipient Type<select value={recipientType} onChange={e=>setRecipientType(e.target.value)}><option>Department</option><option>Student</option><option>Staff</option></select></label><label className={styles.invWide}>Recipient *{recipientType==="Student"?<select name="recipient" required><option value="">Select student</option>{students.map(x=><option key={x.id}>{x.fullName} · {x.className}</option>)}</select>:<input name="recipient" required placeholder={recipientType==="Staff"?"Search staff member…":"e.g., Sports Department"}/>}</label><label>Quantity *<input name="quantity" type="number" min="1" required/></label><label>Issue Date *<input name="date" type="date" defaultValue={today()} required/></label><label className={styles.invWide}>Notes<textarea placeholder="Purpose or authorisation"/></label><button>Issue Item</button></form><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Return Items" subtitle="Outstanding issued inventory"/><div className={styles.inventoryReturns}>{issues.filter(x=>x.returned<x.quantity).map(x=><div key={x.id}><span><b>{x.itemName}</b><small>{x.recipient} · {x.quantity-x.returned} outstanding</small></span><button onClick={()=>onReturn(x,1)}>Return 1</button></div>)}</div></article></section><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Issue / Return Register" subtitle={`${issues.length} issue records`}/><SimpleRecordTable headers={["Date","Item","Issued To","Type","Qty","Returned","Status"]} rows={issues.map(x=>[x.date,x.itemName,x.recipient,x.recipientType,x.quantity,x.returned,x.status])}/></article></>;}

function InventoryPos({items,students,suppliers,onSale}:{items:InventoryItem[];students:Student[];suppliers:InventorySupplier[];onSale:(sale:InventorySale)=>void}){const [cart,setCart]=useState<SaleLine[]>([]),[search,setSearch]=useState(""),[billing,setBilling]=useState("School"),[payment,setPayment]=useState("Cash"),[buyer,setBuyer]=useState("");const shown=items.filter(x=>x.type==="Saleable"&&x.quantity>0&&`${x.name} ${x.sku}`.toLowerCase().includes(search.toLowerCase()));const total=cart.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+x.quantity*x.price*(1-x.discount/100)*(1+x.gst/100),0);function add(item:InventoryItem){setCart(v=>{const line=v.find(x=>x.itemId===item.id);return line?v.map(x=>x.itemId===item.id?{...x,quantity:Math.min(item.quantity,x.quantity+1)}:x):[...v,{itemId:item.id,name:item.name,quantity:1,price:item.sellingPrice,discount:0,gst:0}]});}return <section className={styles.posLayout}><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Point of Sale" subtitle="Select saleable items to build an invoice"/><label className={styles.posSearch}>⌕<input value={search} onChange={e=>setSearch(e.target.value)} placeholder="Search item, SKU or scan barcode…"/></label><div className={styles.posProducts}>{shown.map(x=><button onClick={()=>add(x)} key={x.id}><i>{x.category.slice(0,2).toUpperCase()}</i><span><b>{x.name}</b><small>{x.sku} · {x.quantity} available</small><strong>{inr(x.sellingPrice)}</strong></span><em>＋</em></button>)}</div></article><aside className={`${styles.panel} ${styles.posCart}`}><PanelHead title="Current Sale" subtitle={`${cart.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.quantity,0)} items in cart`}/><div className={styles.posBuyer}><label>Buyer<select value={buyer} onChange={e=>setBuyer(e.target.value)}><option value="">Walk-in Customer</option>{students.map(x=><option key={x.id}>{x.fullName}</option>)}</select></label><label>Billing<select value={billing} onChange={e=>setBilling(e.target.value)}><option>School</option><option>Vendor on behalf</option></select></label>{billing==="Vendor on behalf"&&<label>Vendor<select><option value="">Select vendor</option>{suppliers.map(x=><option key={x.id}>{x.name}</option>)}</select></label>}</div><div className={styles.cartLines}>{cart.length?cart.map(x=><div key={x.itemId}><span><b>{x.name}</b><small>{inr(x.price)} each</small></span><input aria-label={`${x.name} quantity`} type="number" min="1" value={x.quantity} onChange={e=>setCart(v=>v.map(y=>y.itemId===x.itemId?{...y,quantity:Number(e.target.value)}:y))}/><button onClick={()=>setCart(v=>v.filter(y=>y.itemId!==x.itemId))}>×</button><label>Discount %<input type="number" min="0" max="100" value={x.discount} onChange={e=>setCart(v=>v.map(y=>y.itemId===x.itemId?{...y,discount:Number(e.target.value)}:y))}/></label><label>GST %<input type="number" min="0" value={x.gst} onChange={e=>setCart(v=>v.map(y=>y.itemId===x.itemId?{...y,gst:Number(e.target.value)}:y))}/></label></div>):<Empty icon="CART" title="Your cart is empty" text="Choose an item from the catalogue to begin."/>}</div><footer><p><span>Subtotal</span><b>{inr(cart.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.quantity*x.price,0))}</b></p><p><span>Grand Total</span><strong>{inr(total)}</strong></p><label>Payment Mode<select value={payment} onChange={e=>setPayment(e.target.value)}><option>Cash</option><option>UPI</option><option>Card</option><option>Bank Transfer</option></select></label><button disabled={!cart.length} onClick={()=>{onSale({id:crypto.randomUUID(),invoice:`INV-2026-${String(5+Math.floor(Math.random()*9000)).padStart(4,"0")}`,date:today(),buyer:buyer||"Walk-in Customer",billing,vendor:billing==="Vendor on behalf"?suppliers[0]?.name??"":"",net:Math.round(total*100)/100,payment,status:"Completed",lines:cart});setCart([]);}}>Complete Sale &amp; Print Invoice</button></footer></aside></section>;}

function InventorySales({sales}:{sales:InventorySale[]}){return <article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Sales" subtitle="Completed point-of-sale invoices"/><CommExport/><SimpleRecordTable headers={["#","Invoice #","Date","Buyer","Billing","Net","Payment","Status","Actions"]} rows={sales.map((x,i)=>[i+1,x.invoice,x.date,x.buyer,x.billing,inr(x.net),x.payment,x.status,"View · Print"])}/><TablePager count={sales.length}/></article>;}
function InventoryVendorCollections({sales,suppliers}:{sales:InventorySale[];suppliers:InventorySupplier[]}){const rows=suppliers.map(s=>{const vendorSales=sales.filter(x=>x.billing==="Vendor on behalf"&&x.vendor===s.name);return [s.name,s.gstsl,vendorSales.length,inr(vendorSales.reduce((sum,x)=>sum+x.net,0)),vendorSales[0]?.date??"—"];}).filter(x=>Number(x[2])>0);return <><div className={styles.inventoryInfo}>Vendor collections list completed sales billed on a supplier’s behalf. These amounts remain payable to that vendor.</div><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Vendor Collections" subtitle="Supplier-linked retail collections"/><SimpleRecordTable headers={["Vendor","GSTSL","Sales","Total Collected","Last Sale"]} rows={rows}/></article></>;}

function InventoryPurchaseOrders({orders,suppliers,onPage,create,onSave,onStatus}:{orders:PurchaseOrder[];suppliers:InventorySupplier[];onPage:(p:string)=>void;create:boolean;onSave:(po:PurchaseOrder)=>void;onStatus:(id:string,status:string)=>void}){if(create)return <section className={styles.inventoryFormPage}><header><button onClick={()=>onPage("Purchase Orders")}>← Back to Purchase Orders</button><h1>New Purchase Order</h1><p>Prepare a supplier order with delivery and approval details.</p></header><form className={`${styles.panel} ${styles.inventoryForm}`} onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);onSave({id:crypto.randomUUID(),number:`PO-2026-${String(orders.length+14).padStart(4,"0")}`,supplier:String(f.get("supplier")),date:String(f.get("date")),items:String(f.get("items")),total:Number(f.get("total")),status:"Draft"});}}><h2>Purchase Order Details</h2><label>Supplier *<select name="supplier" required><option value="">Select supplier</option>{suppliers.map(x=><option key={x.id}>{x.name}</option>)}</select></label><label>Order Date *<input name="date" type="date" defaultValue={today()} required/></label><label>Expected Delivery<input type="date"/></label><label>Reference<input placeholder="Quotation / requisition no."/></label><label className={styles.invWide}>Items &amp; Quantities *<textarea name="items" required placeholder="A4 Paper × 20 @ ₹270&#10;Marker Set × 8 @ ₹95"/></label><label>Total Amount *<input name="total" type="number" min="0" step=".01" required/></label><label>Terms<select><option>Net 30 days</option><option>Payment on delivery</option><option>Advance payment</option></select></label><label className={styles.invWide}>Notes<textarea placeholder="Delivery and billing instructions"/></label><FormActions cancel={()=>onPage("Purchase Orders")} submit="Save Draft"/></form></section>;return <><div className={styles.inventoryActionBar}><span/><button onClick={()=>onPage("New Purchase Order")}>＋ New PO</button></div><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Purchase Orders" subtitle="Draft, approve, send and receive supplier orders"/><CommExport/><div className={styles.poTable}>{orders.map((x,i)=><div key={x.id}><span>{i+1}</span><p><b>{x.number}</b><small>{x.items}</small></p><span>{x.supplier}</span><span>{x.date}</span><strong>{inr(x.total)}</strong><em className={styles[`po${x.status.toLowerCase()}`]}>{x.status}</em><span>{x.status==="Draft"&&<button onClick={()=>onStatus(x.id,"Sent")}>Approve &amp; Send</button>}<button>View</button></span></div>)}</div></article></>;}

function InventoryReceipts({orders,receipts,items,onReceive}:{orders:PurchaseOrder[];receipts:GoodsReceipt[];items:InventoryItem[];onReceive:(po:PurchaseOrder,itemId:string,quantity:number)=>void}){const [poId,setPoId]=useState(""),[itemId,setItemId]=useState(""),[quantity,setQuantity]=useState(1),po=orders.find(x=>x.id===poId);return <><section className={styles.receiveBar}><label>Purchase Order<select value={poId} onChange={e=>setPoId(e.target.value)}><option value="">Select sent or draft PO</option>{orders.filter(x=>x.status!=="Received").map(x=><option value={x.id} key={x.id}>{x.number} · {x.supplier}</option>)}</select></label><label>Received Item<select value={itemId} onChange={e=>setItemId(e.target.value)}><option value="">Select item</option>{items.map(x=><option value={x.id} key={x.id}>{x.name}</option>)}</select></label><label>Quantity<input type="number" min="1" value={quantity} onChange={e=>setQuantity(Number(e.target.value))}/></label><button disabled={!po||!itemId} onClick={()=>po&&onReceive(po,itemId,quantity)}>Post Goods Receipt</button></section><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Goods Receipts" subtitle="Posted GRNs that increased inventory"/><SimpleRecordTable headers={["#","GRN #","PO #","Supplier","Received Date","Lines","By","View"]} rows={receipts.map((x,i)=>[i+1,x.number,x.po,x.supplier,x.date,x.lines,x.by,"View"])}/></article></>;}

function InventoryPayments({suppliers,orders,payments,onSave}:{suppliers:InventorySupplier[];orders:PurchaseOrder[];payments:SupplierPayment[];onSave:(p:SupplierPayment)=>void}){return <section className={styles.inventorySplit}><form className={`${styles.panel} ${styles.inventoryCompactForm}`} onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);onSave({id:crypto.randomUUID(),supplier:String(f.get("supplier")),po:String(f.get("po"))||"—",amount:Number(f.get("amount")),date:String(f.get("date")),mode:String(f.get("mode")),reference:String(f.get("reference")),by:"Super Admin"});e.currentTarget.reset();}}><PanelHead title="Record Payment" subtitle="Record a payment made to an inventory supplier"/><label>Supplier *<select name="supplier" required><option value="">Select supplier</option>{suppliers.map(x=><option key={x.id}>{x.name}</option>)}</select></label><label>Against PO (optional)<select name="po"><option value="">General payment</option>{orders.map(x=><option key={x.id}>{x.number}</option>)}</select></label><label>Amount *<input name="amount" type="number" min="1" step=".01" required/></label><label>Date *<input name="date" type="date" defaultValue={today()} required/></label><label>Mode<select name="mode"><option>Cash</option><option>Bank Transfer</option><option>Cheque</option><option>UPI</option></select></label><label>Reference<input name="reference" placeholder="UTR / cheque number"/></label><label className={styles.invWide}>Notes<textarea placeholder="Payment note"/></label><button>Save Payment</button></form><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Supplier Payment History" subtitle={`${payments.length} recorded payments`}/><SimpleRecordTable headers={["Date","Supplier","PO","Amount","Mode","Reference","By"]} rows={payments.map(x=>[x.date,x.supplier,x.po,inr(x.amount),x.mode,x.reference,x.by])}/></article></section>;}

function InventorySuppliers({suppliers,setSuppliers}:{suppliers:InventorySupplier[];setSuppliers:(updater:(v:InventorySupplier[])=>InventorySupplier[])=>void}){const [modal,setModal]=useState(false);return <><div className={styles.inventoryActionBar}><span/><button onClick={()=>setModal(true)}>＋ Add Supplier</button></div><article className={styles.panel}><PanelHead title="Suppliers" subtitle="Approved inventory and retail vendors"/><CommExport/><SimpleRecordTable headers={["#","Name","Type","Contact","Phone","GSTSL","Status","Actions"]} rows={suppliers.map((x,i)=>[i+1,x.name,x.type,x.contact,x.phone,x.gstsl,x.status,"View · Edit"])}/><TablePager count={suppliers.length}/></article>{modal&&<div className={styles.commModal}><form onSubmit={e=>{e.preventDefault();const f=new FormData(e.currentTarget);setSuppliers(v=>[{id:crypto.randomUUID(),name:String(f.get("name")),type:String(f.get("type")),contact:String(f.get("contact")),phone:String(f.get("phone")),email:String(f.get("email")),gstsl:String(f.get("gstsl")),status:"Active"},...v]);setModal(false);}}><header><h2>Add Supplier</h2><button type="button" onClick={()=>setModal(false)}>×</button></header><label>Supplier Name *<input name="name" required/></label><label>Supplier Type<select name="type"><option>General</option><option>Book Vendor</option><option>Uniform Vendor</option><option>Medical &amp; Laboratory</option></select></label><label>Contact Person<input name="contact"/></label><label>Phone<input name="phone"/></label><label>Email<input name="email" type="email"/></label><label>GSTSL / Tax ID<input name="gstsl"/></label><div className={styles.modalActions}><button type="button" onClick={()=>setModal(false)}>Cancel</button><button>Save Supplier</button></div></form></div>}</>;}

function InventoryReports({items,movements,sales,orders,payments}:{items:InventoryItem[];movements:StockMovement[];sales:InventorySale[];orders:PurchaseOrder[];payments:SupplierPayment[]}){const groups=[["Stock & Items",[["Stock Valuation",inr(items.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.quantity*x.purchasePrice,0))],["Low Stock / Reorder",items.filter(x=>x.quantity<=x.minStock).length],["Expiry Report",items.filter(x=>x.expiry).length],["Item Master / Catalog",items.length],["Stock Ledger",movements.length],["Dead Stock",items.filter(x=>x.quantity===0).length]]],["Transactions",[["Stock Additions",movements.filter(x=>x.quantity>0).length],["Issue & Return Register",movements.filter(x=>x.kind==="Issued"||x.kind==="Returned").length],["Stock Adjustments",movements.filter(x=>x.kind.includes("Adjustment")).length],["Consumption Report",Math.abs(movements.filter(x=>x.quantity<0).reduce((s,x)=>s+x.quantity,0))]]],["Sales / POS",[["Sales Register",sales.length],["Sales Summary",inr(sales.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.net,0))],["Tax / GST Report",inr(sales.flatMap(x=>x.lines).reduce((s,x)=>s+x.quantity*x.price*x.gst/100,0))],["Refunds",0],["Vendor Collections",sales.filter(x=>x.billing==="Vendor on behalf").length]]],["Procurement",[["Purchase Orders",orders.length],["Goods Received / GRN",orders.filter(x=>x.status==="Received").length],["Supplier Outstanding",inr(Math.max(0,orders.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.total,0)-payments.reduce((s,x)=>s+x.amount,0)))],["Supplier Payments",payments.length],["Supplier Ledger",orders.length+payments.length]]]] as Array<[string,Array<[string,string|number]>]>;return <section className={styles.inventoryReportGrid}>{groups.map(([group,reports])=><article className={styles.panel} key={group}><PanelHead title={group} subtitle="Click a report to view or export"/><div>{reports.map(([name,value])=><button key={name}><i>↗</i><span><b>{name}</b><small>Session-aware operational report</small></span><strong>{value}</strong></button>)}</div></article>)}</section>;}

